<view class="page store-page">
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="empty"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn" bindtap="load">重试</button></view>
  <block wx:else><view class="store-heading"><image src="/assets/icons/store.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="eyebrow">COME IN, STAY A WHILE</text><text class="serif title">把脚步放慢一点。</text><text class="muted small">有新鲜出炉的香气，也有留给你的好位置。</text></view><view class="store-intro"><text class="serif store-name">{{store.name}}</text><text class="small muted">BAKERY · COFFEE · PET FRIENDLY</text><view class="store-hours"><view class="open-dot"/><text>{{store.hours}}</text></view><text class="store-description">一间欢迎朋友与毛孩子的小屋。烘焙、甜品与咖啡，在这里慢慢发生。</text></view>
  <view class="store-detail"><view class="store-info-row"><image src="/assets/icons/address.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text class="small muted">FIND US / 门店地址</text><text>{{store.address}}</text><text class="link small" bindtap="copyAddress">复制演示地址</text></view></view><view class="store-info-row"><image src="/assets/icons/coffee.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text class="small muted">OPENING HOURS / 营业时间</text><text>{{store.hours}}</text></view></view><view class="store-info-row"><image src="/assets/icons/info.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text class="small muted">SAY HELLO / 联系方式</text><text>{{store.phone}}</text><text class="link small" bindtap="phoneInfo">查看演示电话说明</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="fulfillment-rules"><text class="eyebrow">GOOD THINGS, NEAR AND FAR</text><text class="serif section-title">到店，或把美味带回家</text><view class="rule-row"><image src="/assets/icons/delivery.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>外卖配送</text><text class="small muted">{{store.deliveryRule}}</text></view></view><view class="rule-row"><image src="/assets/icons/shipping.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>全国邮寄</text><text class="small muted">{{store.shippingRule}}</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="store-actions"><button class="btn" data-mode="pickup" bindtap="order">选一份，到店自取</button><button class="btn-outline" data-mode="dineIn" bindtap="order">坐下来，店内点单</button></view><view class="notice fictional-note">虚构门店 · 本页地址、电话、营业时间和服务区域均为课程演示设定，无真实地图、拨号或门店服务。</view></block>
</view>
